{
  "schema": "evidence-producers-1",
  "note": "Every artifact in docs/evidence/ must appear here, naming what produces or consumes it and how to regenerate it. Evidence nobody can regenerate cannot be checked for staleness, and evidence nobody reads is not evidence — the transport appendix documented a CLI invocation no test exercised, stayed wrong through a full package rename, and nothing noticed. test_evidence_freshness.py enforces this file.",
